 をちゃんと使い始めたのは最近で、少なくとも私の体験上では「今まで動いていた」ということはないです","ts":"1621823923.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cvo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06faab4b-b60a-484b-931b-cdd26f0d8ce1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"動作を見た限りだと、文字化けはするけどアクセスはできてますね","ts":"1621823870.039800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wu=k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2de29d3f-096a-41c1-996f-f170bca2481a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"むしろ「いままで動いてた」的な証言のほうが理由がわからず???ってなる。ちょっとバージョンとかちゃんと見ないとアカンだろうけど。","ts":"1621823721.039100","thread_ts":"1621823721.039100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OpqTF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"788d12c3-39d9-4886-98ed-5a3442f96d97","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうすると copy.exe にココでUTF-8が書かれるはずだから、そりゃ文字化けするかもなぁという感じはする。\n\u003chttps://github.com/atotto/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard_unix.go#L139-L147\u003e","ts":"1621823680.038300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: atotto/clipboard","id":1,"title":"atotto/clipboard","title_link":"https://github.com/atotto/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard_unix.go#L139-L147","text":"clipboard for golang. Contribute to atotto/clipboard development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/59a446938324b05d45b7d0cf56a827dc39930d57bb753bf880b642d95e300040/atotto/clipboard","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/atotto/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard_unix.go#L139-L147","original_url":"https://github.com/atotto/clipboard/blob/master/clipboard_unix.go#L139-L147"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OBFDS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21694dca-146a-47ce-af6d-ed98289a095a","type"